\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the Online Unified Evidence Graph (OUEG) framework. Two-stage retrieval anchors table rows and expands Wikipedia hyperlink passages. A query-time multigraph preserves record nodes, qualified headers, and rule-based text triples. OUEG compresses the full evidence subgraph while enumerating non-filtering suggested paths, assessing structural score-collision ambiguity before generating the answer.}}{6}\protected@file@percent }
